OL,3,GNEWSAWhy some Wolverhampton-licensed
OL,4,Ataxis were taken off the road
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of licensed taxis were found to
OL,7,Fhave safety and compliance issues with
OL,8,Fabout a third of them being ordered off
OL,9,Fthe road as part of a day of action.
OL,11,FIt follows a crackdown on private hire
OL,12,Fvehicles that do not meet the required
OL,13,Fstandards to carry passengers.
OL,15,FThe operation was spearheaded by the
OL,16,FCity of Wolverhampton Council along
OL,17,Fwith other local authorities and
OL,18,Fagencies, including North West
OL,19,FLeicestershire District Council and
OL,20,FLeicester Police.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
